# Build-time staging only — NEVER commit this directory.
#
# deploy-gateway.yml copies contracts/model-gateway/{openapi,redaction-rules}.yaml
# from the repository root into here immediately before `docker build`, because
# Docker's COPY cannot reach outside its build context (which is this
# directory). The staged files are ephemeral CI artifacts.
#
# Committing them would create a SECOND copy of two frozen v1 contract files
# that contracts/.frozen-v1.sha256 does not guard, free to drift silently away
# from the originals. The repo-root copies remain the only source of truth.
contracts/
